    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "University of Canterbury's ceilometer data collected at Macquarie Island 2016-2018, Vaisala CL51. Hourly netCDF format data files containing the raw backscattered signal from the ceilometer, along with the Vaisala-derived cloud base heights and detection status. Data collected on a Vaisala CL51 ceilometer located inside the Met enclosure supplied by the University of Canterbury.\n\nResolution: 10m vertically x 6 seconds.\n\nTime period: 02 April 2016 \u2013 13 March 2018\n\nAll times in UT (Universal Time)\n\nData converted into netCDF files by Peter Kuma, University of Canterbury.",
